WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:05.414
Here's how to put a staff member's documents and certificates into Title22.

00:05.664 --> 00:07.950
Open the menu, and tap Staff.

00:08.200 --> 00:09.788
Tap Add staff.

00:10.263 --> 00:12.918
Type their name, and add the hire date.

00:13.636 --> 00:17.927
For a CPR card, tap Scan, and take a photo of the card.

00:18.177 --> 00:26.272
Title22 reads only the two CPR dates, and checks the name on the card. Look them over, then tap Fill form.

00:26.821 --> 00:30.278
The dates are in, and the photo is kept with her record.

00:30.528 --> 00:35.778
TB results are never scanned. Type the test date and the next due date yourself.

00:36.028 --> 00:39.421
Then tap Upload, to keep the signed paper on file.

00:39.671 --> 00:43.023
Add the rest the same way, like her Live Scan clearance.

00:43.273 --> 00:44.640
Tap Save.

00:44.890 --> 00:52.039
Her dates are on her card. Anything still missing is marked, and Title22 warns you before a date runs out.

00:52.289 --> 00:55.520
Try it free for thirty days. No card needed.
